# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS - never commit. The signed-findings channel's private key lives here,
# and topic.txt names the channel: on ntfy the topic name IS the password.
# Nothing in share/keys/ is needed to read or reuse the design - a consumer runs
# `node src/share.js init` to generate their own channel.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
share/keys/
share/topic.txt
*.key.pem
*.pem
.env
.env.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime scratch / atomic-write temporaries (the collector writes *.tmp then
# renames). Never commit a half-written checkpoint.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.log
node_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
